WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.403 --> 00:00:04.415
Drop files on markdrop.in/share — no account needed

2
00:00:04.415 --> 00:00:07.688
Share the link, or let them scan the QR code

3
00:00:07.688 --> 00:00:10.464
Point a phone camera at it

4
00:00:10.464 --> 00:00:13.353
The phone connects straight to the laptop

5
00:00:13.353 --> 00:00:15.928
Files stream device to device, encrypted

6
00:00:15.928 --> 00:00:19.333
People shows each device, how far it got, and Direct or Relayed

7
00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:23.299
On an iPhone, one tap saves them to Photos

8
00:00:23.299 --> 00:00:28.058
Done? End sharing and the link stops working

9
00:00:28.058 --> 00:00:30.860
The phone keeps what it saved
